OL,3,AJoshua Wong, face of Hong Kong's
OL,4,Apro-democracy protests, jailed for 10
OL,5,Ayears
OL,6,
OL,7,FJoshua Wong, once the face of Hong
OL,8,FKong's democracy movement, has been
OL,9,Fsentenced to 10 years in jail for
OL,10,Fcolluding with foreign forces under the
OL,11,Fcity's sweeping national security law.
OL,13,FWong is among hundreds of campaigners
OL,14,Fand ordinary Hongkongers arrested under
OL,15,Fthe law, which was imposed in 2020
OL,16,Ffollowing explosive pro-democracy
OL,17,Fprotests against Beijing's growing
OL,18,Fcontrol.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
